---
description: Clear, accessible Next.js scientific interface with bounded loading.
globs: apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Read apps/web/README.md and use vercel-react-best-practices for React/Next work.
Use web-design-guidelines when asked to review UI or accessibility.
Keep TanStack Query for remote state. Lazy-load Aladin and Plotly in client components;
the browser receives previews and bounded metadata. Write interface text in English.
Show units, epochs, provenance, uncertainties, and actual empty/error states.
Temporal blink needs pause controls, keyboard navigation, and reduced-motion support.
Do not present AI-generated images as astronomical observations.
